      "description": "A derogatory racial and class-based stereotype historically used to demean people of lower socioeconomic status, often implying laziness, lack of education, or moral inferiority. This term is inherently racist and classist, relying on harmful racialized and class-based assumptions to insult the subjects. It is commonly used in American vernacular to mock appearance, behavior, or lifestyle deemed 'trashy' or 'unrefined'.",
